## Philosophy

Vavadane represents the **ephemeral adventurer** - progress is temporary, identity is shared. She exists as a way to experience the world without attachment to permanence. Anyone can be vavadane for a day.

The embedding-derived equipment makes her outfit feel "fated" rather than random - the same credentials always produce the same signature look, as if her appearance is written into the nature of who she is.
